---
// src/tools/media/flip-rotate/About.astro
import { AccordionCard } from '@/core/components/ui';
---

<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
  
  <AccordionCard title="How to use this tool" defaultOpen={true} client:load>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 mt-2">
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold mt-1">1</div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1">Upload Image</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Select an image from your device using the upload gallery.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold mt-1">2</div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1">Transform</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Use the controls to rotate the image 90 degrees or flip it horizontally/vertically.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold mt-1">3</div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1">Apply and Download</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Click "Apply Transform", wait for the local rendering to finish, and download your image.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </AccordionCard>

  <AccordionCard title="Project Overview" client:load>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Flip & Rotate is a fully client-side image transformation tool. It allows you to apply lossless rotations and flips to your images without uploading them to a server.
    </p>
    <p>
      Because everything runs locally in your browser using the HTML5 Canvas API, it guarantees 100% privacy and operates at native speeds.
    </p>
  </AccordionCard>

  <AccordionCard title="Why this tool exists" client:load>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Fixing a sideways phone photo or mirroring an image shouldn't require heavyweight design software or uploading your private files to the cloud.
    </p>
    <p>
      This tool provides instant, local transformations while strictly preserving your image's original EXIF metadata, DPI, and alpha channel (transparency).
    </p>
  </AccordionCard>

  <AccordionCard title="Under the hood (Architecture)" client:load>
    <p class="mb-4">
      This tool leverages a modern, lightweight architecture optimized for performance:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mb-4 text-sm">
      <li><strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Framework:</strong> Astro & React (Isomorphic rendering with minimal hydration).</li>
      <li><strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">State Management:</strong> Zustand (Normalized, high-performance file store).</li>
      <li><strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Storage:</strong> OPFS (Origin Private File System) and IndexedDB for direct disk access.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Image Processing:</strong> HTML5 Canvas API for matrix transformations and EXIF data preservation.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Zero backend. Zero API keys. Zero cloud storage. Just pure, local computation.
    </p>
  </AccordionCard>

</div>